spanish-text-classifier-lora — model bundle NOTICE
==================================================

This distribution contains a fine-tuned intent-classification model produced
by the spanish-text-classifier-lora project, version {version}.

Base model
----------
Base model: {base_model}
Base model licence: {base_license}
The model was modified by LoRA fine-tuning on the MASSIVE 1.0 es-ES dataset.
The released weights are distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(see LICENSE).

Training data
-------------
Amazon MASSIVE 1.0 (es-ES), licensed under CC BY 4.0, Copyright Amazon.com
Inc. MASSIVE is human-localised from SLURP (CC BY 4.0). The repository bundles
only a small sample excerpt for tests; the full dataset is downloaded from the
pinned upstream URL and verified by sha256.

Third-party software
--------------------
This bundle is consumed with onnxruntime and tokenizers. Their licences are
distributed with those packages and are not part of this archive.

Modifications
-------------
The base model was adapted with LoRA (low-rank adapters) and merged for
CPU-only ONNX inference. No other changes were made to the base weights beyond
the adapter merge.
